## System Architecture

### High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Client Layer"
        WEB[Web Application]
        MOBILE[Mobile Application]
        DESKTOP[Desktop Application]
    end

    subgraph "CDN & Load Balancer"
        CDN[CloudFlare CDN]
        LB[Application Load Balancer]
    end

    subgraph "API Gateway"
        GATEWAY[API Gateway]
